div.p:
The following rivers are declared international: 

the Elbe (Labe) from its confluence with
                            the Vltava (Moldau), and the Vltava (Moldau) from Prague;

the Oder (Odra) from its confluence with
                            the Oppa;

the Niemen (Russstrom-Memel-Niemen) from
                            Grodno;

the Danube from Ulm;
